      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DYNAMIC THEORY (4) booted up from the inside draw to sit on the speed last start then stuck on well to finish 1.2 lengths away in third over 1100m at this track. Nicely placed to take this out. LUNA FIELD (1) was well-fancied last time out but could only manage third over 1000m seven days ago. Goes well at this circuit and is expected to be in the finish. TELLEZ (3) finished tenth over 1000m at Alice Springs at his most recent appearance on May 30. Off a short break. Tricky gate but expected to prove hard to beat. SNAPPY SWEETHEART (6) was out of the money two runs back when fresh from a spell then again missed the frame last start over 1200m at this track, beaten 7 lengths into seventh. Has her share of talent and is a top-three prospect. DAD BOD (2) is another better than recent form and worth including.",
